WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 8

01:40.940 --> 01:42.560
The Crown Prince will know about

01:42.580 --> 01:44.450
us meeting each other sooner or later.

01:45.010 --> 01:46.480
Aren't you worried about that?

01:46.500 --> 01:47.500
Your Highness, do you know any girl

01:47.500 --> 01:49.130
who likes to eat drumsticks?

01:50.540 --> 01:52.850
Do you believe love at first sight?

01:56.650 --> 01:58.640
I didn't either,

01:59.370 --> 02:01.200
but I do now.

02:01.730 --> 02:03.280
I met a girl

02:03.300 --> 02:05.090
who had a drumstick in her hand.

02:05.260 --> 02:06.220
I want to share the story

02:06.220 --> 02:07.520
with you.

02:07.540 --> 02:08.600
Are you interested?

02:08.620 --> 02:09.710
Yeah.

02:09.730 --> 02:11.890
Go ahead. I'm all ears.

02:13.780 --> 02:16.970
This poem is amazing!

02:17.490 --> 02:19.240
Judging from it,

02:19.260 --> 02:21.170
I think Fan Xian is of much talent.

02:22.370 --> 02:23.760
Auntie,

02:23.930 --> 02:26.320
it's not bad if Wan'er marries him.

02:26.340 --> 02:28.040
He deserves her.

02:28.060 --> 02:30.400
Besides the poem,

02:30.420 --> 02:32.160
His Majesty also sent me word that

02:32.180 --> 02:34.200
Chengze is in urgent need of talents

02:34.290 --> 02:37.520
and he's meeting Fan Xian

02:37.540 --> 02:39.370
in Prince Jing's mansion.

02:40.620 --> 02:42.560
It'll be late even if you hurry there.

02:49.210 --> 02:51.040
Chengze is scheming.

02:51.060 --> 02:52.210
He's been thinking about

02:52.210 --> 02:54.330
taking over Neiku.

02:55.700 --> 02:57.840
Luckily, we got the word in time.

02:58.060 --> 02:59.890
We still have time to make preparations.

03:00.260 --> 03:01.480
It seems

03:01.620 --> 03:04.650
His Majesty

03:04.650 --> 03:06.610
cares about you more.

03:07.370 --> 03:08.560
Auntie,

03:08.980 --> 03:11.320
why do you hate Fan Xian so much?

03:11.340 --> 03:13.530
Of course it's for the throne.

03:17.290 --> 03:18.760
Drink some tea.

03:19.980 --> 03:21.890
I've told you the whole story

03:22.210 --> 03:24.280
of me and the drumstick girl.

03:24.570 --> 03:26.040
Did you get it?

03:28.490 --> 03:30.090
Yes. Got it.

03:30.490 --> 03:31.890
No, you didn't.

03:33.290 --> 03:34.890
I want to marry her.

03:36.450 --> 03:39.120
But my father and your father

03:39.140 --> 03:40.680
want you to marry Wan'er.

03:40.700 --> 03:42.690
I don't agree.

03:44.140 --> 03:46.170
Now that I want to break off my marriage contract,

03:46.260 --> 03:48.370
I won't take over Neiku.

03:51.540 --> 03:54.370
The marriage contract is approved by my father.

03:55.820 --> 03:57.600
How will you break it off?

03:57.620 --> 03:59.450
Just wait and see.

04:02.780 --> 04:05.180
What if you can't

04:05.180 --> 04:06.550
see the drumstick girl anymore?

04:06.570 --> 04:08.690
I've been lucky.

04:16.140 --> 04:17.480
Fan Xian,

04:18.170 --> 04:19.760
I'm eager to see

04:19.820 --> 04:22.320
what you're going to do next.

05:20.420 --> 05:22.140
Let's kill that chicken

05:22.140 --> 05:23.690
and cut it up later.

05:55.490 --> 05:57.130
Do you want it?

05:57.460 --> 05:59.010
No.

06:04.610 --> 06:07.200
Let's eat what we like.

06:13.260 --> 06:14.690
Did you steal it?

06:16.890 --> 06:18.370
Are you hungry?

06:19.020 --> 06:21.010
Not really.

06:21.140 --> 06:22.690
Do you live here?

06:26.300 --> 06:28.310
You're not allowed to eat drumsticks?

06:28.330 --> 06:29.440
Are you a maidservant?

06:32.460 --> 06:35.370
Help yourself. Eat.

06:37.330 --> 06:38.190
You...

06:38.210 --> 06:39.700
I can't do it with you staring at me.

06:39.700 --> 06:40.280
It's okay.

06:40.300 --> 06:42.480
I like to watch others eat drumsticks.

06:56.090 --> 06:57.120
How about you?

06:57.140 --> 06:58.850
Why are you here?

07:00.210 --> 07:01.530
I'm...

07:02.700 --> 07:03.890
I'm a servant.

07:03.890 --> 07:04.580
I'm here with my Young Master

07:04.580 --> 07:06.160
for the poetry gathering.

07:06.650 --> 07:07.610
Look. You're a maidservant.

07:07.610 --> 07:08.330
I'm a servant.

07:08.330 --> 07:09.750
What a perfect match!

07:09.770 --> 07:11.370
I don't think so.

07:11.370 --> 07:13.200
You don't live here.

07:13.370 --> 07:14.020
How about

07:14.020 --> 07:15.240
me transferring here?

07:15.260 --> 07:17.480
It's not as simple as you think.

07:18.300 --> 07:19.850
Who...

07:20.020 --> 07:22.440
Who is your Young Master?

07:23.930 --> 07:25.760
Um. I'm...

07:26.300 --> 07:27.560
Persimmon?

07:27.580 --> 07:28.720
You really came here.

07:28.740 --> 07:29.650
Aren't you afraid to lose face?

07:29.650 --> 07:30.680
A master of words.

07:30.700 --> 07:32.280
I have no other feat left.

07:32.300 --> 07:33.720
I will kill you.

07:33.740 --> 07:34.960
How dare you!

07:34.980 --> 07:39.600
"At the tower, I stand in the mist."

07:40.370 --> 07:41.210
Guo Baokun.

07:41.210 --> 07:42.140
He's my Young Master.

07:42.140 --> 07:43.600
We're here for the poetry gathering.

07:46.260 --> 07:47.470
I've heard he's competing

07:47.490 --> 07:48.960
with Fan Xian in poetry.

07:48.980 --> 07:50.630
He lost badly.

07:50.650 --> 07:52.490
He can't do it at all.

07:52.490 --> 07:54.250
He's stupid.

07:54.460 --> 07:56.720
Isn't he your Master?

07:56.740 --> 07:58.090
But I'm righteous.

07:58.090 --> 07:59.320
I don't tell lies.

08:03.860 --> 08:05.030
You coughed up blood that day.

08:05.050 --> 08:07.010
What happened?

08:08.700 --> 08:10.520
He hit me.

08:10.540 --> 08:12.040
He often did that.

08:13.460 --> 08:14.750
But you look happy

08:14.770 --> 08:16.880
when you said that.

08:17.540 --> 08:19.320
It's because I saw you.

08:23.860 --> 08:25.240
Help yourself.

08:25.260 --> 08:27.570
You can eat the drumstick while talking to me.

08:41.730 --> 08:42.680
Is Fan Xian

08:42.700 --> 08:44.690
also there?

08:47.220 --> 08:49.040
Can you show me which one is him?

08:50.460 --> 08:52.120
Why do you want to see him?

08:52.140 --> 08:54.480
Nothing. I'm just curious.

08:56.410 --> 08:58.080
Forget about it if you don't want to.

09:07.820 --> 09:09.280
What are you doing?

09:09.340 --> 09:11.960
Go. I'll show you who is Fan Xian.

09:28.460 --> 09:30.370
That one.

09:38.530 --> 09:40.600
He looks a little serious.

09:42.490 --> 09:44.370
I think he's just so so.

09:49.100 --> 09:50.600
Are you married?

09:51.530 --> 09:52.440
Why are you asking this?

09:52.460 --> 09:53.960
I'm just curious.

09:55.140 --> 09:56.390
No.

09:56.410 --> 09:58.770
What a coincidence! Neither am I.

09:58.850 --> 10:00.520
I didn't ask you.

10:02.020 --> 10:04.160
Between a serious man like him and a handsome man like me,

10:04.900 --> 10:06.920
which one do you like better?

10:09.730 --> 10:11.350
Your Master is gone.

10:11.370 --> 10:12.640
Go look for him.

10:12.660 --> 10:15.600
No hurry. You haven't answered me yet.

10:18.490 --> 10:19.840
I'm leaving.

10:20.020 --> 10:21.570
What's your name?

10:45.580 --> 10:47.810
Fan, what are you looking at?

10:51.410 --> 10:52.770
Youth.

10:54.780 --> 10:56.280
Youth?

11:09.170 --> 11:10.600
My Lady.

11:15.970 --> 11:17.560
You scared me.

11:17.580 --> 11:19.270
Why are you eating a drumstick again?

11:19.290 --> 11:20.350
The doctor said

11:20.370 --> 11:22.600
you have to go vegetarian.

11:26.260 --> 11:28.390
Let's go to the poetry gathering.

11:28.410 --> 11:29.680
I'm not going.

11:29.700 --> 11:30.710
You said you'd tell Fan Xian

11:30.730 --> 11:32.690
you don't want to marry him.

11:33.290 --> 11:35.250
After that servant has left.

11:35.610 --> 11:37.840
Servant? Which one?

11:41.460 --> 11:42.840
Nothing.

11:44.260 --> 11:45.560
The poetry gathering has finished.

11:45.580 --> 11:46.680
How about

11:46.700 --> 11:47.370
us going to the Fan mansion

11:47.370 --> 11:48.810
directly?

11:56.850 --> 11:57.960
Let's go.

12:42.370 --> 12:43.770
What are you doing?

12:45.660 --> 12:47.010
Your Excellency.

12:48.460 --> 12:49.560
My daughter

12:49.580 --> 12:51.200
is picky about food.

12:51.220 --> 12:52.800
I want to let her know

12:52.820 --> 12:55.010
how the dessert served here tastes.

12:56.340 --> 12:57.880
No problem,

12:57.900 --> 12:59.600
but do you have to come here by climbing the wall?

13:00.900 --> 13:01.760
Your Excellency,

13:01.780 --> 13:03.590
it's troublesome to come in from the front door.

13:03.610 --> 13:04.490
I don't want to be questioned.

13:04.490 --> 13:05.760
That's why I did it.

13:05.780 --> 13:07.080
There are some jars

13:07.100 --> 13:08.530
near the wall.

13:08.530 --> 13:09.660
They made me fall down.

13:09.660 --> 13:10.460
Can you have them

13:10.460 --> 13:11.460
moved to somewhere else?

13:11.460 --> 13:12.890
Cut the crap.

13:13.410 --> 13:14.810
How is that thing going?

13:16.050 --> 13:17.240
Here is the file

13:17.260 --> 13:19.080
you need.

13:19.580 --> 13:21.840
File D No. 534.

13:21.930 --> 13:23.100
It's all

13:23.100 --> 13:24.960
about Teng Zijing.

13:25.290 --> 13:26.390
Your Excellency,

13:26.410 --> 13:27.660
Teng Zijing was killed

13:27.660 --> 13:29.950
in Danzhou.

13:29.970 --> 13:31.890
Why do you need it?

13:31.930 --> 13:32.710
Are you curious?

13:32.730 --> 13:33.490
No. No. No.

13:33.490 --> 13:35.390
I shouldn't have said that.

13:35.410 --> 13:36.820
Take your time.

13:36.820 --> 13:38.830
I'm leaving.

13:38.850 --> 13:41.080
I'll take this to my daughter.

13:42.460 --> 13:43.770
Hold on.

13:44.530 --> 13:45.490
Don't cross the wall.

13:45.490 --> 13:46.770
Go to the front door.

13:47.460 --> 13:49.370
Is it...

13:52.930 --> 13:54.170
Just go straight ahead.

13:54.170 --> 13:55.100
Tell the gatekeeper

13:55.100 --> 13:56.720
I gave the dessert to you.

13:58.660 --> 14:00.210
Thank you, Your Excellency.

14:12.610 --> 14:13.950
Wang Qinian once saw me,

14:13.970 --> 14:15.400
so I have to avoid him.

14:16.290 --> 14:18.010
It says something

14:18.340 --> 14:20.450
about my wife and son, right?

14:31.220 --> 14:32.880
Calm down.

14:32.900 --> 14:34.080
Give it to me.

14:40.820 --> 14:42.600
Everything was okay.

14:43.050 --> 14:44.770
Why are they fighting?

14:59.660 --> 15:03.040
I'll help you no matter what.

15:09.580 --> 15:10.890
Calm down.

15:10.970 --> 15:12.170
We need to be more thoughtful

15:12.170 --> 15:13.810
at this moment.

15:16.850 --> 15:18.130
Thoughtful?

15:18.820 --> 15:19.370
You want me

15:19.370 --> 15:21.510
to be patient, right?

15:21.530 --> 15:23.150
I just want to say

15:23.170 --> 15:25.210
I can give you a hand

15:25.410 --> 15:26.490
no matter what you want to do.

15:26.490 --> 15:27.590
Don't bother!

15:27.610 --> 15:28.340
We're bound to each other by no ties.

15:28.340 --> 15:30.010
You don't have to do anything for me!

15:33.050 --> 15:34.280
Hold on.

15:44.820 --> 15:46.470
Stay out of

15:46.490 --> 15:48.080
my business.

16:00.530 --> 16:01.770
What's the matter?

16:02.370 --> 16:03.900
His wife and son were killed.

16:03.900 --> 16:05.130
Who did it?

16:07.260 --> 16:09.130
Guo Baokun is ruthless.

16:13.660 --> 16:15.400
My Lady, are you okay?

16:16.290 --> 16:17.480
I'm good.

16:19.170 --> 16:20.120
Fan Xian.

16:20.140 --> 16:21.200
Are you sure?

16:21.220 --> 16:22.530
I saw him in Prince Jing's mansion.

16:22.530 --> 16:24.010
I couldn't be wrong.

16:24.050 --> 16:25.450
Mr. Fan.

16:29.660 --> 16:31.520
I'm here

16:31.580 --> 16:33.210
to talk about our marriage contract.

16:34.580 --> 16:36.400
Why is he so rude?

16:37.700 --> 16:39.400
Judging from his poems,

16:39.490 --> 16:41.030
he couldn't be like this.

16:41.050 --> 16:43.510
He must've become arrogant after rising to fame.

16:43.530 --> 16:45.150
My Lady,

16:45.170 --> 16:46.650
you'd better not marry him.

16:47.170 --> 16:48.650
I'm afraid

16:49.020 --> 16:50.800
Teng Zijing wants to kill Guo Baokun.

16:50.820 --> 16:52.010
I know.

16:52.290 --> 16:53.810
He fell out with you

16:54.260 --> 16:55.320
on purpose.

16:55.340 --> 16:56.650
I know.

16:56.850 --> 16:58.400
He doesn't want to get me involved.

16:59.460 --> 17:00.760
I didn't expect

17:00.780 --> 17:02.600
Guo Baokun is so cruel.

17:03.860 --> 17:05.200
Where do you think

17:05.460 --> 17:07.110
I can find Guo Baokun tonight?

17:07.130 --> 17:07.960
Brother!

17:07.980 --> 17:09.410
Help me find it out.

17:13.100 --> 17:14.530
He...

17:15.340 --> 17:17.220
He may be found by the Liujing River.

17:17.220 --> 17:18.370
Why?

17:18.580 --> 17:21.290
Guo Baokun is a playboy.

17:21.500 --> 17:23.720
He visits the brothels all the year round.

17:24.220 --> 17:25.770
You can find that line of business a lot

17:26.010 --> 17:27.600
along the Liujing River.

17:27.620 --> 17:29.130
How did you know that?

17:30.170 --> 17:31.800
I checked his background

17:32.220 --> 17:35.480
after you fell out with him.

17:36.100 --> 17:38.250
Brother, he works for the Crown Prince after all.

17:38.250 --> 17:40.050
No matter what you do,

17:40.130 --> 17:41.840
you have to keep yourself safe.

17:41.860 --> 17:42.990
I see.

17:43.010 --> 17:44.200
Ruoruo,

17:44.220 --> 17:45.360
get someone

17:45.380 --> 17:47.770
to send word to Li Hongcheng.

17:57.530 --> 17:59.890
Your Highness, it's cleared up.

18:03.410 --> 18:05.250
The atmosphere here is good.

18:05.860 --> 18:07.410
It's like real life.

18:09.380 --> 18:10.290
I'd love to

18:10.290 --> 18:12.170
share happiness with common people,

18:13.380 --> 18:14.930
but I don't like to stay with them.

18:16.770 --> 18:18.320
What are you going to do tonight?

18:19.410 --> 18:20.480
Fanxian invited me

18:20.500 --> 18:21.960
to go to the Liujing River.

18:21.980 --> 18:23.980
He's heard that

18:23.980 --> 18:25.460
there are many beautiful girls there.

18:25.460 --> 18:26.820
He wants to drink and chat with me.

18:26.820 --> 18:27.990
Where are you going to meet?

18:28.010 --> 18:29.340
He said he's a newcomer,

18:29.340 --> 18:31.250
so it's up to me.

18:31.580 --> 18:32.560
Your Highness,

18:32.580 --> 18:33.460
you said

18:33.460 --> 18:35.340
you fell in love with a girl at first sight.

18:35.340 --> 18:36.620
Why did he

18:36.620 --> 18:38.410
want to visit brothels?

18:38.860 --> 18:40.370
Interesting.

18:40.580 --> 18:41.750
So,

18:41.770 --> 18:43.250
shall I go or not tonight?

18:43.250 --> 18:44.560
Of course you should do it.

18:44.580 --> 18:46.200
Where should I...

18:48.460 --> 18:49.840
All right.

18:56.050 --> 18:58.480
Ling'er, help me.

18:58.930 --> 18:59.870
Don't worry.

18:59.890 --> 19:00.890
I'll go to the Fan family

19:00.890 --> 19:02.050
and force him to say sorry to you.

19:02.050 --> 19:03.110
No.

19:03.130 --> 19:04.270
If he doesn't do it,

19:04.290 --> 19:06.440
I'll punch him till he changes his mind.

19:08.290 --> 19:10.410
I mean...

19:13.010 --> 19:14.480
I mean,

19:15.580 --> 19:17.170
can you

19:17.820 --> 19:19.030
go to

19:19.050 --> 19:20.390
Guo Baokun's servant?

19:20.410 --> 19:22.170
No problem. I'm going...

19:25.740 --> 19:27.250
What?

19:27.530 --> 19:32.290
Guo Baokun's servant?

19:34.460 --> 19:35.580
I've heard he spit up blood

19:35.580 --> 19:36.580
after being hit by Guo Baokun

19:36.580 --> 19:37.910
at the poetry gathering.

19:37.930 --> 19:39.440
Can you go there

19:39.460 --> 19:41.030
and confirm he's all right?

19:41.050 --> 19:42.480
OK?

19:43.770 --> 19:45.440
How did you

19:45.460 --> 19:48.440
know Guo Baokun's servant?

19:48.740 --> 19:50.080
You don't have to know about that.

19:50.100 --> 19:51.320
Just tell me

19:51.340 --> 19:52.930
if you'll do it or not.

20:00.650 --> 20:02.150
Sir, I haven't seen you for a long time.

20:02.170 --> 20:02.870
This way, please.

20:02.890 --> 20:04.110
This way, please.

20:04.130 --> 20:05.800
On the third floor as usual.

20:06.860 --> 20:07.620
This is one of the most well-known brothels

20:07.620 --> 20:09.230
in the capital city.

20:09.250 --> 20:10.620
They have several pleasure boats on the river.

20:10.620 --> 20:11.990
It's said the most popular courtesan here

20:12.010 --> 20:13.800
is kind of related to the royal bloodline.

20:13.820 --> 20:15.360
The Guo family has lots of rules to follow,

20:15.380 --> 20:18.290
so Guo Baokun always goes home before midnight.

20:19.740 --> 20:21.230
Where are you going?

20:21.250 --> 20:22.680
I'm going inside with you.

20:22.820 --> 20:24.200
Go back.

20:24.620 --> 20:26.150
Let me go with you.

20:26.170 --> 20:27.500
Father will teach me a good lesson

20:27.500 --> 20:28.480
if he knows

20:28.500 --> 20:29.750
I take you here.

20:29.770 --> 20:31.320
I won't tell him.

20:31.340 --> 20:32.650
Ruoruo.

20:33.890 --> 20:35.230
I'll be distracted

20:35.250 --> 20:37.050
if you go inside with me.

20:37.620 --> 20:38.360
I promise

20:38.380 --> 20:39.930
I won't act rashly.

20:42.860 --> 20:43.870
Go back.

20:43.890 --> 20:45.170
But...

20:47.290 --> 20:48.800
Brother!

20:50.340 --> 20:52.840
This way, please.

20:57.820 --> 21:00.270
=Joy Tsin House=

21:04.740 --> 21:06.360
Sorry to have kept you waiting, Li.

21:06.380 --> 21:07.800
I just arrived.

21:07.820 --> 21:09.030
Your poems

21:09.050 --> 21:10.560
are being delivered.

21:14.650 --> 21:16.010
Who's there on the pleasure boat?

21:16.010 --> 21:17.500
A new courtesan

21:17.500 --> 21:18.910
called Si Lili.

21:18.930 --> 21:20.200
She's a little famous,

21:20.220 --> 21:21.960
but she seldom shows up.

21:22.170 --> 21:24.440
Many men spent lots of money,

21:24.460 --> 21:26.650
but they still failed to see her.

21:26.860 --> 21:27.890
So, what's the point of

21:27.890 --> 21:28.870
sending my poems there?

21:28.890 --> 21:29.800
She is different

21:29.820 --> 21:30.840
from others.

21:30.860 --> 21:33.480
Let's go inside and keep waiting there. Go.

21:52.250 --> 21:53.440
This way.

22:13.410 --> 22:14.720
This way.

22:43.530 --> 22:47.170
Wen Ruohan: melodies lingering.

22:47.410 --> 22:49.890
She's good at chimes and archaic music.

22:49.890 --> 22:51.110
The Board of Rites

22:51.130 --> 22:53.170
even asked her for advice on sacrificial culture.

23:08.050 --> 23:11.320
Du Erniang: get you tipsy.

23:11.460 --> 23:12.440
Steaming liquor.

23:12.460 --> 23:14.480
She's expert at steaming liquor.

23:14.500 --> 23:16.370
You must have a taste next time.

23:25.380 --> 23:27.840
Sex is never the best way to please a man.

23:27.860 --> 23:28.960
This is the most popular place

23:28.980 --> 23:30.150
among blue bloods,

23:30.170 --> 23:31.010
because

23:31.010 --> 23:32.320
they can always find

23:32.340 --> 23:33.440
a bosom friend here

23:33.460 --> 23:34.870
no matter what hobbies they have

23:34.890 --> 23:36.480
or what they're obsessive about.

23:39.380 --> 23:43.290
Meng Xiaoyun: autumnal ripples.

23:56.410 --> 24:00.600
Miss Si Lili's boat is coming over!

24:00.620 --> 24:01.960
Come and check it out!

24:04.010 --> 24:04.650
Follow me!

24:04.650 --> 24:05.840
Who is it for?

24:10.820 --> 24:13.170
Who is the lucky guy?

24:14.650 --> 24:15.930
Hurry up.

24:32.130 --> 24:34.200
Si Lili!

24:37.530 --> 24:38.960
Si Lili!

24:38.980 --> 24:40.800
Si Lili!

24:40.820 --> 24:43.960
Si Lili, look at me!

24:55.500 --> 24:58.930
Si Lili!

25:02.410 --> 25:04.770
Look at me!

25:12.290 --> 25:14.650
Here!

25:15.820 --> 25:19.130
Miss Lili, here!

25:21.290 --> 25:25.600
Miss Lili! Miss Lili!

25:25.770 --> 25:28.800
Si Lili, look at me!

25:28.820 --> 25:31.050
She's coming over toward me.

25:31.050 --> 25:33.560
Here!

25:34.170 --> 25:36.250
Yeah. She's coming over.

25:36.250 --> 25:37.480
I'm nervous.

25:37.500 --> 25:39.100
Pleasure boat is drawing near.

25:39.100 --> 25:40.680
Gorgeous fireworks light up the night sky

25:40.700 --> 25:43.010
each time when Miss Si Lili comes over.

25:43.580 --> 25:45.230
Her boat has never moved before.

25:45.250 --> 25:47.270
She's coming over for you.

25:47.290 --> 25:49.030
And she's never invited a man back.

25:49.050 --> 25:50.890
She's still a virgin.

25:52.290 --> 25:54.130
Miss Lili.

25:58.170 --> 25:59.960
Fan, are you nervous?

26:01.220 --> 26:02.750
I'm trying to adapt to it.

26:02.770 --> 26:03.770
Beautiful!

26:03.770 --> 26:05.650
You've never been in a brothel?

26:05.650 --> 26:07.770
Yes, never in this life and my past life.

26:10.530 --> 26:11.680
It's different from

26:11.700 --> 26:13.360
what's shown on TV.

26:13.380 --> 26:14.630
Sorry?

26:14.650 --> 26:15.960
Nothing.

27:00.010 --> 27:01.560
She's coming over.

27:01.580 --> 27:02.720
There she is.

27:02.740 --> 27:04.080
There she is.

27:07.890 --> 27:10.800
Is she a fairy from Heaven? Gorgeous!

27:12.530 --> 27:14.480
So beautiful.

27:25.580 --> 27:26.720
Miss Lili.

27:26.740 --> 27:27.820
Miss Lili.

27:27.820 --> 27:29.050
Let's go.

27:30.050 --> 27:31.250
Hurry up. Follow me.

27:31.250 --> 27:32.890
Miss Lili.

27:34.380 --> 27:35.870
Amazing.

27:35.890 --> 27:37.530
Miss Lili.

27:38.930 --> 27:40.560
Miss Lili.

27:43.890 --> 27:45.840
It's His Highness.

27:45.980 --> 27:47.050
That explains why.

27:47.050 --> 27:50.030
Si Lili: ink plum blossom.

27:50.050 --> 27:51.000
Miss Lili,

27:51.000 --> 27:51.050
=Si Lili, courtesan of Joy Tsin House=
Miss Lili,

27:51.050 --> 27:52.380
=Si Lili, courtesan of Joy Tsin House=
you're really elegant and beautiful.

27:52.380 --> 27:53.080
=Si Lili, courtesan of Joy Tsin House=

27:53.100 --> 27:54.930
He's Mr. Fan.

27:55.130 --> 27:56.770
Who is that guy?

27:58.980 --> 28:00.410
Mr. Fan.

28:04.130 --> 28:05.990
I've been thinking

28:06.010 --> 28:07.250
what kind of person

28:07.250 --> 28:09.410
can write such a poem.

28:10.700 --> 28:13.320
I like your poem.

28:14.250 --> 28:16.010
And

28:16.410 --> 28:17.960
you're also not bad.

28:19.580 --> 28:21.560
How about a boat trip on the lake?

28:24.460 --> 28:26.870
A gifted scholar and a lovely lady. Perfect!

28:26.890 --> 28:28.680
Fan, it seems

28:28.700 --> 28:30.840
you'll stay overnight on the boat.

28:31.700 --> 28:32.750
His Highness,

28:32.770 --> 28:34.890
I'm not that kind of person.

28:40.460 --> 28:43.530
Let me drink a toast to you, Miss Lili.

28:44.460 --> 28:45.410
Mr. Fan,

28:45.410 --> 28:47.560
I'll be yours tonight.

28:47.580 --> 28:49.410
Please be gentle with me.

31:06.130 --> 31:08.560
He drugged me, but didn't sleep with me.

31:08.580 --> 31:10.200
Shall I follow him?

31:11.050 --> 31:12.410
No.

31:13.130 --> 31:14.910
We can't risk our identities.

31:14.930 --> 31:16.360
You can leave.

31:16.380 --> 31:17.930
Stay alert.

31:27.010 --> 31:28.680
Fan Xian,

31:29.460 --> 31:31.440
what on earth do you want to do?

32:28.170 --> 32:29.750
Why are you here?

32:29.770 --> 32:31.960
I'm here for a walk after a party with girls.

32:33.860 --> 32:35.630
Why did he kill your wife and son?

32:35.650 --> 32:36.750
It was just something trivial.

32:36.770 --> 32:38.030
He didn't need to do that.

32:38.050 --> 32:39.270
Some guys are cruel by nature.

32:39.290 --> 32:40.560
They're beasts in human clothing.

32:40.580 --> 32:41.290
They're unreasonable.

32:41.290 --> 32:42.150
The file says

32:42.170 --> 32:43.800
he ordered his men to burst into
your house and kill your family.

32:43.820 --> 32:44.560
It's something an arrogant man would do.

32:44.580 --> 32:45.530
He's not that kind of person.

32:45.530 --> 32:46.650
You don't understand his true nature.

32:46.650 --> 32:48.080
He asked the magistrate to punish you

32:48.100 --> 32:49.980
according to the law.

32:49.980 --> 32:51.050
Do you think he'd ignore the law

32:51.050 --> 32:52.800
when it came to your family?

32:54.500 --> 32:55.910
What on earth do you want to say?

32:55.930 --> 32:57.370
We have to take our time.

32:57.930 --> 32:58.410
Guo Baokun

32:58.410 --> 33:00.010
is not that kind of person.

33:00.130 --> 33:02.250
Don't you want to find out the truth?

33:12.620 --> 33:14.720
Are we already there?

33:21.290 --> 33:23.530
Where the hell is it?

33:42.290 --> 33:43.770
Who is it?

34:12.770 --> 34:14.560
Who is it?

34:14.660 --> 34:16.160
Do you know who I am?

34:16.180 --> 34:17.190
We're familiar with each other.

34:17.210 --> 34:18.190
Of course I do.

34:18.210 --> 34:20.860
You are... Fan Xian?

34:20.860 --> 34:21.840
Exactly.

34:21.860 --> 34:22.990
What do you want to do?

34:23.010 --> 34:23.730
I have a question for you.

34:23.730 --> 34:24.950
How dare you

34:24.970 --> 34:26.840
do this to me?

34:26.970 --> 34:28.270
You bastard.

34:28.290 --> 34:29.420
Hit me to death if you dare!

34:29.420 --> 34:31.490
Okay. I'll do as you say.

34:32.580 --> 34:34.840
I won't leave it at that.

34:36.580 --> 34:38.840
I'll report it to His Majesty.

34:40.620 --> 34:42.530
Do you know why I recited

34:42.530 --> 34:44.370
that poem in the daytime?

34:44.530 --> 34:46.880
"A thousand miles from home,
I'm grieved at autumn's plight."

34:46.900 --> 34:48.990
"Ill now and then for years, alone I'm on this height."

34:49.010 --> 34:50.640
I'm telling you.

34:50.660 --> 34:52.840
I want you to be grieved.

34:53.180 --> 34:55.470
I'll hit you hard

34:55.490 --> 34:56.420
so that you get sick

34:56.420 --> 34:58.930
and become a joke.

34:59.380 --> 35:00.400
Stop it!

35:00.420 --> 35:02.690
Stop it!

35:03.010 --> 35:04.490
Please stop it.

35:04.770 --> 35:07.080
What's your question?

35:07.100 --> 35:08.050
Why did you kill

35:08.050 --> 35:09.470
Teng Zijing's wife and son?

35:09.490 --> 35:10.800
What?

35:11.180 --> 35:13.080
Don't play the fool.

35:13.100 --> 35:14.770
I really have no idea.

35:14.770 --> 35:16.140
Hold on. Hold on. Hold on.

35:16.140 --> 35:18.000
I remember.

35:18.620 --> 35:20.000
What do you remember?

35:20.620 --> 35:23.840
I remember Teng Zijing,

35:24.250 --> 35:26.450
but his family has nothing to do with me.

35:26.450 --> 35:27.450
You killed them.

35:27.450 --> 35:29.450
How dare you say that?

35:30.420 --> 35:31.840
I didn't!

35:31.860 --> 35:33.340
-I don't know them. -Fine.

35:33.340 --> 35:34.450
You won't tell the truth?

35:34.450 --> 35:35.890
I'll hit you to death.

35:35.940 --> 35:37.470
I didn't do it

35:37.490 --> 35:40.520
even if you killed me.

35:40.900 --> 35:44.170
I really didn't kill them.

35:53.380 --> 35:55.320
I don't think he's lying.

35:56.490 --> 35:57.530
But the file says so.

35:57.530 --> 35:59.000
It couldn't be wrong.

35:59.100 --> 36:00.050
It also says

36:00.050 --> 36:01.690
you're dead.

36:04.820 --> 36:06.370
Do you mean

36:06.490 --> 36:08.160
the file maybe false?

36:08.180 --> 36:10.000
I don't know. We need to find it out.

36:10.620 --> 36:11.600
You can kill him

36:11.620 --> 36:13.730
after finding the truth out.

36:14.050 --> 36:15.600
If it's really him,

36:15.620 --> 36:16.950
I won't stop you.

36:16.970 --> 36:18.280
What should we do now?

36:18.450 --> 36:20.280
Do you know where Wang Qinian lives?

36:21.340 --> 36:22.320
Let me ask Wang Qinian about it

36:22.340 --> 36:23.320
when we see him.

36:23.340 --> 36:23.970
If something really goes wrong

36:23.970 --> 36:25.080
with the file,

36:25.100 --> 36:26.560
he must know something about it.

36:26.580 --> 36:27.620
Wang Qinian is good at lightness skill.

36:27.620 --> 36:29.130
It's not easy to catch him.

36:29.450 --> 36:31.120
We can do it

36:31.140 --> 36:32.520
if he's unprepared.

36:36.380 --> 36:37.890
Do what?

36:38.580 --> 36:40.080
Wang Qinian!

36:45.140 --> 36:47.080
Wang Qinian!

37:03.970 --> 37:06.120
Your Excellency, your hearing is excellent.

37:06.140 --> 37:08.760
I've followed you all the way indeed.

37:11.250 --> 37:12.470
You're alive!

37:12.490 --> 37:13.970
Was my family

37:14.010 --> 37:15.930
killed by Guo Baokun?

37:18.970 --> 37:23.730
Your wife and son are safe.

37:23.940 --> 37:25.890
They live outside the city.

37:26.450 --> 37:28.430
I'll take you to them if you don't believe.

37:28.450 --> 37:29.970
How about the file?

37:31.620 --> 37:34.190
I was afraid he'd kill them

37:34.210 --> 37:35.900
after killing you,

37:35.900 --> 37:36.950
so...

37:36.970 --> 37:38.660
So you changed

37:38.660 --> 37:40.600
the file?

37:41.620 --> 37:43.600
The file was just there.

37:43.620 --> 37:45.190
I took it to you the next day

37:45.210 --> 37:47.450
just to make a false one.

37:50.940 --> 37:52.450
Where are they?

38:06.660 --> 38:08.040
Right here.

38:17.450 --> 38:19.080
Don't you want to go inside?

39:10.290 --> 39:14.080
Who is it? It's too late.

39:14.210 --> 39:17.040
If you have something, please come here tomorrow morning.

39:19.900 --> 39:21.490
It's me.

39:46.010 --> 39:49.210
They said you're dead.

39:50.010 --> 39:51.490
I'm back.

39:54.490 --> 39:56.750
I thought you're dead.

39:56.770 --> 39:58.120
I thought you're dead.

39:58.140 --> 39:59.510
I thought you're dead.

39:59.530 --> 40:00.670
I thought you're dead.

40:00.690 --> 40:02.990
I thought I'd never see you again.

40:03.010 --> 40:05.320
I thought I'd never see you again.

40:26.970 --> 40:28.410
Where is our son?

40:30.690 --> 40:32.130
He's asleep.

40:32.530 --> 40:34.800
Come in.

41:03.860 --> 41:05.450
He's taller and stronger.

41:07.380 --> 41:09.170
You're finally back.

41:10.450 --> 41:11.840
I'm back.

41:12.820 --> 41:14.130
I'm back.

41:15.290 --> 41:16.970
Everything will be alright.

41:34.010 --> 41:37.280
He'll stay here tonight, right?

41:37.380 --> 41:39.210
Wang Qinian.

41:39.420 --> 41:41.030
Your Excellency, here I am.

41:41.050 --> 41:42.730
You come and go like a shadow.

41:43.180 --> 41:45.490
Why did you tail after me?

41:45.860 --> 41:47.750
I just want to see

41:47.770 --> 41:50.170
what you're going to do next.

41:50.580 --> 41:52.000
I'm sorry.

41:52.580 --> 41:54.360
I'm narrow-minded.

41:54.380 --> 41:55.560
I got you wrong.

41:55.580 --> 41:57.800
Please forgive me.

41:57.820 --> 42:00.320
You have a good relationship with Teng Zijing?

42:01.690 --> 42:04.270
Actually, just an acquaintance.

42:04.290 --> 42:06.650
So, why did you protect his family?

42:06.730 --> 42:08.510
Teng Zijing once worked for the Investigator's Office.

42:08.530 --> 42:10.970
I knew something about his background.

42:11.730 --> 42:13.190
I think

42:13.210 --> 42:14.710
what he did

42:14.730 --> 42:16.730
is a little admirable.

42:17.250 --> 42:20.490
When I heard of his death,

42:20.530 --> 42:21.970
I thought

42:22.100 --> 42:22.690
I should look after

42:22.690 --> 42:24.490
his wife and son.

42:24.490 --> 42:25.950
How did they

42:25.970 --> 42:28.080
move here?

42:28.660 --> 42:30.040
I was afraid

42:30.180 --> 42:32.430
someone else wants to kill them,

42:32.450 --> 42:35.490
so I bought the house.

42:39.420 --> 42:40.340
What if

42:40.340 --> 42:42.130
I really wanted to kill them?

42:47.860 --> 42:49.520
What would you do?

43:16.080 --> 43:19.660
In the river of history,

43:19.680 --> 43:23.150
time goes round and round.

43:25.960 --> 43:29.300
Memories about the former and present lives

43:29.320 --> 43:33.390
join each other in an endless way.

43:35.280 --> 43:37.900
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:37.920 --> 43:40.160
one season follows another in a flash,

43:40.160 --> 43:42.660
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:42.680 --> 43:44.280
I just can't give up

43:44.280 --> 43:47.620
to be with you for my whole life.

43:47.640 --> 43:53.110
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:54.360 --> 43:56.910
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:57.200 --> 43:59.240
Year after year in the wandering,

43:59.240 --> 44:01.900
I count the remaining years.

44:01.920 --> 44:04.100
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:04.120 --> 44:06.110
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:06.400 --> 44:08.790
I never feel regretful.

44:08.840 --> 44:10.200
In such a chaotic world,

44:10.200 --> 44:13.180
I still miss you as ever.

44:13.200 --> 44:16.150
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:16.440 --> 44:18.500
With a gentle heart,

44:18.520 --> 44:21.180
I cherish our remaining years.

44:21.200 --> 44:22.720
Even though we have to go through

44:22.720 --> 44:25.230
all the hardships along the journey,

44:25.360 --> 44:32.550
you always stay by my side,

44:32.640 --> 44:35.310
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:35.600 --> 44:37.680
Year after year in the wandering,

44:37.680 --> 44:40.340
I count the remaining years.

44:40.360 --> 44:42.500
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:42.520 --> 44:44.750
even though we end up the destiny,

44:44.960 --> 44:47.140
I never feel regretful.

44:47.160 --> 44:48.560
In such a chaotic world,

44:48.560 --> 44:51.620
I still miss you as ever.

44:51.640 --> 44:54.750
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:54.840 --> 44:56.980
With a gentle heart,

44:57.000 --> 44:59.700
I cherish our remaining years.

44:59.720 --> 45:01.160
Even though we have to go through

45:01.160 --> 45:03.820
all the hardships along the journey,

45:03.840 --> 45:12.600
you always stay by my side...
